<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/publications/mpr/mpr-2026-07-15/">
    <title>Monetary Policy Report—July 2026</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/publications/mpr/mpr-2026-07-15/</link>
    <description>Canada's economy has been weak but is showing signs of improvement. Growth is expected to pick up, and inflation is projected to ease to around 2%. Uncertainty remains elevated.</description>
