        </cb:news>
</item>
<item rdf:about="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/publications/mpr/mpr-2026-01-28/">
    <title>Monetary Policy Report—January 2026</title>
    <link>https://www.bankofcanada.ca/publications/mpr/mpr-2026-01-28/</link>
    <description>The Canadian economy continues to adjust to US tariffs and the new global trade landscape. This adjustment will take time and growth is expected to be modest. Inflation is projected to remain near the 2% target.</description>
    <dc:date>2026-01-28T09:46:43+00:00</dc:date>
